  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maize Post-Harvest Handling Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Maize.Beneficiaries: 2343 (1499 women).Description: The group seeks to improve post-harvest maize handling by obtaining additional drying equipment to ensure safe storage of maize, decreasing spoilage and enabling increased profits by selling later when prices increase. The grantee will also acquire a truck to reduce transportation costs and maize shellers to enable their own post-harvest processing. .</narrative>
  </description>
